    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/04b51f702e803d39280c7a7f271cb7a7.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an Intergalactic Outlaw who has stumbled upon a drifting, abandoned Space-Cruiser. Seize the opportunity to explore and seek answers to the greatest secrets of the Cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the sinister Galactic Force constantly on your tail, you\u2019ll find yourself on the edge between life and death. Scavenge  vast Extraterrestrial Planets, build up your defenses, gear up, and prepare for the inevitable clash with The Evil Force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/6a66cb3f6f808d3bc36ddcb30969be16.poster.avif?t=1731056825\" width=794 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/6a66cb3f6f808d3bc36ddcb30969be16.webm?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/6a66cb3f6f808d3bc36ddcb30969be16.mp4?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/cbd1a07bb35ffee54cda0aa637acb2e6.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your newly found Spaceship isn\u2019t in great shape. To traverse the galaxy, you\u2019ll need Antimatter Fuel.\u00a0Collect resources and materials from strange Alien Planets, then build devices to help achieve your goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, scavenging is not an easy job, as you\u2019ll need to solve puzzles, battle alien creatures, and withstand harsh environments along the way. Work together as a Team! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/ca616fb008d2dc27652292b1958c8f3f.poster.avif?t=1731056825\" width=794 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/ca616fb008d2dc27652292b1958c8f3f.webm?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/ca616fb008d2dc27652292b1958c8f3f.mp4?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/e2d6bb94f9fdd16bc946ba5541d24209.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to obtain Antimatter. You can choose from various Dungeons and Mini-Games within the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spacecraft is filled with creatures, booby traps, and other dangers, so there\u2019s plenty of cleanup work to do.\u00a0It can get pretty silly and tricky, as the dungeons are randomized, and you\u2019ll never know what you\u2019re getting  into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/b0ba1fc140922cbf95cfc9ab73ae48e6.poster.avif?t=1731056825\" width=796 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/b0ba1fc140922cbf95cfc9ab73ae48e6.webm?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/b0ba1fc140922cbf95cfc9ab73ae48e6.mp4?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/65e11a45deb4091eeb40ea2708bebc55.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you decide to do first... looting other planets for resources, prioritizing fuel production, building up your base, or embarking on thrilling adventures hunting down exotic creatures... remember that the most important rule in the entire Universe is to Have Fun while doing it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/04b51f702e803d39280c7a7f271cb7a7.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an Intergalactic Outlaw who has stumbled upon a drifting, abandoned Space-Cruiser. Seize the opportunity to explore and seek answers to the greatest secrets of the Cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the sinister Galactic Force constantly on your tail, you\u2019ll find yourself on the edge between life and death. Scavenge  vast Extraterrestrial Planets, build up your defenses, gear up, and prepare for the inevitable clash with The Evil Force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/6a66cb3f6f808d3bc36ddcb30969be16.poster.avif?t=1731056825\" width=794 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/6a66cb3f6f808d3bc36ddcb30969be16.webm?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/6a66cb3f6f808d3bc36ddcb30969be16.mp4?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/cbd1a07bb35ffee54cda0aa637acb2e6.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your newly found Spaceship isn\u2019t in great shape. To traverse the galaxy, you\u2019ll need Antimatter Fuel.\u00a0Collect resources and materials from strange Alien Planets, then build devices to help achieve your goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, scavenging is not an easy job, as you\u2019ll need to solve puzzles, battle alien creatures, and withstand harsh environments along the way. Work together as a Team! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/ca616fb008d2dc27652292b1958c8f3f.poster.avif?t=1731056825\" width=794 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/ca616fb008d2dc27652292b1958c8f3f.webm?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/ca616fb008d2dc27652292b1958c8f3f.mp4?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/e2d6bb94f9fdd16bc946ba5541d24209.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to obtain Antimatter. You can choose from various Dungeons and Mini-Games within the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spacecraft is filled with creatures, booby traps, and other dangers, so there\u2019s plenty of cleanup work to do.\u00a0It can get pretty silly and tricky, as the dungeons are randomized, and you\u2019ll never know what you\u2019re getting  into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/b0ba1fc140922cbf95cfc9ab73ae48e6.poster.avif?t=1731056825\" width=796 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/b0ba1fc140922cbf95cfc9ab73ae48e6.webm?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/b0ba1fc140922cbf95cfc9ab73ae48e6.mp4?t=1731056825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269410/extras/65e11a45deb4091eeb40ea2708bebc55.webp?t=1731056825\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you decide to do first... looting other planets for resources, prioritizing fuel production, building up your base, or embarking on thrilling adventures hunting down exotic creatures... remember that the most important rule in the entire Universe is to Have Fun while doing it!</p>",
